{"name":"native-convergence","commit":{"sha":"a1f7250815eee803d931301ab46207719cb9a15b","node_id":"C_kwDOS6pZOtoAKGExZjcyNTA4MTVlZWU4MDNkOTMxMzAxYWI0NjIwNzcxOWNiOWExNWI","commit":{"author":{"name":"ruyimg","email":"2689302609@qq.com","date":"2026-10-30T17:34:03Z"},"committer":{"name":"ruyimg","email":"2689302609@qq.com","date":"2026-10-30T17:34:03Z"},"message":"feat(resources): resolve declared character audio and cross-pack forms\n\nUse static source declarations and exact global character ownership to resolve\n23,393 declared audio aliases without exposing shared skill pools. Preserve the\n12,359 original resource rows and payloads; show each character's actual declared\nvoices and keep playback failures isolated by path.\n\nValidated on main: resource tests 11/11, frontend 167/167, source sync and both\nverify modes, 121 complete audio decodes, 14 controls playbacks, 214 real HTTP\nidentity checks, and nine failure/recovery cases. Final preflight 21/21 and the\nindependent integration review passed; historical cleanup failure and known five\nChrome codec failures remain recorded. Rules330/archive105/ABI758/WS6 unchanged.\n\nRegister the separately accepted da7e GitHub run41082599800 (10/10 successful\njobs) with raw evidence and independent review. Private C331, NC10, and five-file\ncodec compatibility implementations are not part of this runtime increment.","tree":{"sha":"abb64b4d7aeabc3f1e2525887b88bca46b0e9133","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/git/trees/abb64b4d7aeabc3f1e2525887b88bca46b0e9133"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/git/commits/a1f7250815eee803d931301ab46207719cb9a15b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/commits/a1f7250815eee803d931301ab46207719cb9a15b","html_url":"https://github.com/Ruyi